FUNCTION HTTPGET(URL)
* mvx-lang/curl — HTTP GET via libcurl through jBASE DEFC (JBCURLGET), returning
* the response body on a 2xx status ("" otherwise).  libcurl handles TLS,
* redirects and binary bodies.  Needs libjbcurl.so on the library path, which
* the package's install puts there.  GPL-2.0-only.
*
* The body comes back through an ARGUMENT, not the return value: DEFC declares a
* function whose return jBASE reads as a number, and the C side writing an
* argument VAR is visible to the caller.  The return is the HTTP status, which
* the UniData arm cannot report at all -- there a 404 and an empty 200 are the
* same empty string.
   DEFC VAR JBCURLGET(VAR, VAR)
   RESP = ""
   RC = JBCURLGET(URL, RESP)
   RETURN(RESP)
